  "slug": "notfullybroken",
  "title": "NotFullyBroken",
  "description": "If elytra don't fully break, why should tools with Mending?",
  "body": "![NotFullyBroken](https://i.imgur.com/ItFPIV0.gif)\n<p align=\"center\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/59d7a8fac766c091fcf316a1cc9446577cddf239_0.webp\" alt=\"About\" width=\"300\">\n</p>\nIn Minecraft, you can easily break your best tools if something distracts you. <b>NotFullyBroken</b> fixes that. Now, all tools with mending and 0 durability will change to their broken state, in which you can't use them. To move them out of the broken state, you simply recover them using XP.\n\n---\n\n<center>  \n  <a href=\"https://buymeacoffee.com/mars_team\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/2790d549f708e4c82ef641eb22ee125a31652f59.png\" alt=\"Buy Me a Coffee link\" width=\"230\">\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/MARSTeamMC/NotFullyBroken\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/4aa7b71db7546baed1efdca321de9ebd3586629b.png\" alt=\"GitHub link\" width=\"251\">\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"https://discord.com/invite/bYXrZ7aQWn\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/2880575df25f9221da8c5f18fc06b9546277f3c6.png\" alt=\"Discord link\" width=\"265\">\n  </a>\n</center>\n\n---\n<p align=\"center\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c51cf8d9225cac4df352699d0375dcafeb075380_0.webp\" alt=\"Features\" width=\"411\">\n</p>\n\n- Tools with Mending on brake will change to their broken equivalent, saving all their data.\n- Broken tools change to the original item when you absorp xp.\n- You can use a broken tool to mine and hit, but it's as efficient as doing this with hand.\n- You can't break the broken tool.\n- All broken tool assets in 1.21.10\n![All Broken Tools in 1.21.10](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Nln6eVHu/images/73cce033a7db3588c5b6554524d5a24dc6e9c590.png)\n\n---\n\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/MARSTeamMC/Image2Banners\">\n    <img src=\"https://drive.google.com/u/0/drive-viewer/AKGpihYBlUn14n-cd_-4JD2zKYhxZOkgcHKojbxjWxNSj59aRH4p70Q6Vdhw3Fwc-hPoWkjtwbOBIRKWKNXQ6kkbL-PJhmE2-dugP98=s2560?auditContext=forDisplay\" alt=\"Image2Banners\" width=\"434\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/noweatherskip\">\n    <img src=\"https://drive.google.com/u/0/drive-viewer/AKGpihYbkTUucRbKv9eOiQkjufEwJlMJVcfCxRdSY6x883WCkUw_wPuETrzY-g_NcyV86y-PubQdd4CdPREK4m_EZLxApj0cPWWwwoU=s2560?auditContext=forDisplay\" alt=\"NoWeatherSkip\" width=\"434\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/instantbreak\">\n    <img src=\"https://drive.google.com/u/0/drive-viewer/AKGpihYmK_0eDBaNg97m-lzfDAvYI-VyWGp08VN63SQ8Sqi6xHSyd01Smv8Tb9mQQh3v0ngWeg-iqJyeuMJXY91H0calTIlRaXGNKGE=s2560?auditContext=forDisplay\" alt=\"InstantBreak\" width=\"434\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/notfullybroken\">\n    <img src=\"https://drive.google.com/u/0/drive-viewer/AKGpihZhH5g_CL3wr0On88aRteML-i5PGOpe4g20QrMDxj2mQXqFc9nnMAK_-9-Vt6Zhjtvvlbi_I_d2eHeTh1g3AMBdKI8fTy1RWA=s2560?auditContext=forDisplay\" alt=\"NotFullyBroken\" width=\"434\">\n</a>\n</p>\n\n---\n\n<center>\n  <h3>License</h3>\n<p>This project is licensed under the BSD 2-Clause License.</p>\n<p>Developed by the MARS Team MC.</p>\n</center>\n",
